- grouping-p-tst-hangs: `grouping-p.tst` times out at test 34
  ("subshell ending with asynchronous list"), which exercises
  `(echo foo >fifo1&)` — an asynchronous list inside a subshell
  with output redirection. The shell hangs waiting for the
  background process. Related to `async-list-behavior-broken`.
  `grouping-p.tst:34`.

